/-!
# S9-C3h82c: constitutive full-dual response of a P286 connection second jet

C3h82a supplies the complete holonomic Hessian domain of the existing
primitive P286 connection, and C3h82b derives its actual curvature first-jet
symbol.  This module installs that Hessian over the current C3h78 repair and
recomputes the already generated P286 constitutive auxiliary from the varied
actual curvature.

The resulting origin Euler--Lagrange displacement is classified by a genuine
real-linear map from connection Hessians to the complete residual dual.  Its
formula is generated by the existing positive-source coupling, coframe and BF
pairing.  No residual target, preimage, inverse, coefficient, source slot,
branch receipt, or stationarity certificate is accepted.
-/

